  <div class="case-study">
    <div class="cs-eyebrow"><span class="cs-badge">Case Study</span><span class="cs-context">State University — How the go/no-go worked</span></div>
    <p class="cs-prose">Before starting the analysis, the project lead booked a go/no-go meeting with the VP of Enrollment and technical architect for week four. The analysis found: 14-day average document review time, 60% of counselor hours spent on manual verification, no standardized checklist, and peer universities achieving same-day verification using AI document processing. The team arrived at the meeting with a clear recommendation to proceed — and the VP approved staffing within 48 hours.</p>
