    <p class="cs-prose">The future state vision was: AI verifies documents in under two hours, automatically notifies applicants about missing items, and surfaces only exceptions to counselors — eliminating the manual review step entirely. MVP scope: document verification and the counselor exception queue. Out of scope for the 90-day build: outreach propensity model, conversational applicant interface, transcript evaluation. All three went onto the post-MVP backlog. Outreach was scheduled for Wave 2, pending CRM data quality improvements.</p>
